    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Global Properties presents this spacious three bedroom semi detached home, that is situated in the gated Bellevue Court development. This property is in excellent condition throughout and given its close proximity to Cork City, it will be in high demand. \r\n\r\nThe Old Youghal Road area is a well-established and convenient residential location in Cork, offering a good balance of city accessibility and a quieter suburban setting. The area benefits from its proximity to Cork City centre, while also providing easy access to local shops, schools, public transport and a wide range of amenities. Its established residential surroundings and convenient road connections make it an attractive location for both homeowners and investors."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation:\r\nEntrance Hallway \r\nThe front door opens to a spacious tiled hallway and gives access to the living room and kitchen.\r\n\r\nKitchen/ Dining Area - 6.01m x 3.76m\r\nThis stunning, fully fitted kitchen boasts a large selection of wall and floor units with a two large countertops. Rear access to the back. Tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 5.14m x 3.96m\r\nLarge living room with excellent natural lighting and an electric fireplace. Tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nCarpeted stairs to the first floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.83m x 3.94\r\nLarge double room, built in wardrobe, timber flooring, window blinds.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.22m x 3.94m \r\nLarge double room, timber flooring, window blinds & curtains.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.34m x 1.98m\r\nSingle room, timber flooring, window blinds.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 1.93m 1.78m\r\nW.C, wash hand basin, shower, tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nFront Garden\r\nTarmac driveway & parking. Side gate to rear garden\r\n\r\nBack Garden\r\nLow maintenance gravel back garden, concrete block walls with side gate."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Gated Development\r\n96 sq mt/ 1033 sq ft\r\nGas Fired Central Heating\r\nGreat Condition\r\nExcellent Location\r\nModernised Throughout\r\nWithin close proximity to shops & 24 Hour Bus Service"
      },
      {
